Z||000000||tgowens||04-17-2001||12:44 PM||||It looks like I'll be taking the Med. Red Metallic '87 GT with the 5-sp Getrag on a road trip to the Fiero Factory for the swap meet the end of this month.......<P>We (George is going with me) will be going down 99 to Bakersfield, across 58 to I-40.....We'll be on I-40 through Arizona, New Mexico, Texas, Oklahoma, and on into Alabama............<P>If there is anyone on that route that wants to meet us for coffee somewhere, let me know...My guess is that we will be in CA and AZ on the 24-25th, NM and TX on the 25-26th and OK and AL on the 26-27th.........i'll update this as we get closer to the trip....<P>Oh, by the way, this will be a good opportunity to see the 88 style anti-bumpsteer suspension produced by the Fiero Shop on the '87.........<P>------------------<BR>My Fiero Web Site.....<BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero/index.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tgowens.gif">         </A><P>87 GT - Gold automatic<BR>87 GT - Blue automatic<BR>87 GT - Med. Red Met. 5-speed Getrag||||reg||1
