Z||000023||stimpy||04-20-2001||01:12 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Spektyr:<BR><B>I could make it down to OKC on the 26th.  If there's going to be a group gathered there, where would I find them?<P>85 GT</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Come on down, I'll make sure there's enough chicken fried to go around.  I'm right around the way from Will Rogers airport off of I-44 at SW 59.<BR>That's a long way to come for some Del Rancho, but it would be cool to meet more forum members. What would be REALLY cool is if you could make it down May 19th for Fiero Club of Oklahoma's Southweest Regional Fiero show. We have quite a day planned. We'll be showing our cars at Ferguson Pontiac from 10a-3p, then adjourning to a local park for catered BBQ and BYOB malted beverages. Around 6p we'll be caravaning to Coit's drive-in for a cruise-in. Definately worth the trip.<P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
